Subject: [PATCH] add layer-shell support

---
 configure.ac                 |  14 +++
 src/Makefile.am              |   2 +
 src/desktop/desktop-window.c | 238 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 src/desktop/desktop.c        |  30 ++++-
 src/main.c                   |  14 ++-
